{"message":"For a personal card with no annual fee, the best documented option is the **Gold Rewards Card**: **2.5% cash back on all purchases** and a **$0 annual fee**. It does require an active Rho‑Bank+ premium subscription and a minimum credit score of 720.

If you don’t want a premium subscription, the **Bronze Rewards Card** has **no annual fee** and earns **1% cash back on everyday purchases**.

The highest overall cash-back rate is the **Platinum Rewards Card at 10%**, but it carries a **$200 annual fee**, so it doesn’t meet your no-fee preference. Approval and credit terms are subject to review."}

{
