  "reason": "It offers the highest documented cash-back rate among Rho-Bank personal cards with no annual fee: 2.5% on all purchases.",
  "important_condition": "An active Rho-Bank+ premium subscription is required. The card itself has a $0 annual fee, but the subscription may have its own cost.",
